node_modules/
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo
.DS_Store
# What a fixture build leaves behind when it is run in place rather than by `tools/next-matrix`.
.next/
.ppr-cdn/
# A project's local storage: the databases, namespaces and buckets `upwind dev` and `upwind build`
# bind. It is a developer's own data, and it is rebuilt from nothing by deleting it.
.upwind/
fixtures/*/package-lock.json
# Worktrees an agent puts under its own tool directory: a second checkout of this repository, which
# every tool that walks the tree would otherwise lint, format and count as this one's files.
.claude/worktrees/
